{"body":{"branch_id":"B2","constraint_refs":[{"id":"record:sha256:5737e38e9e5e4c6a6214d51ced7f66690a62fd3f7bcb549db8799012d5cee25b","kind":"constraint","required":true,"schema_version":"eidomancer.record.schema.v0.2"},{"id":"record:sha256:b66a1d46b27e8c726a887fd4b9d4d8c37bec652739effece5a8fd8c11aad02e8","kind":"constraint","required":true,"schema_version":"eidomancer.record.schema.v0.2"},{"id":"record:sha256:6ba48f60cdd814e4aadbc2b0fab5bd354eefd6e1ed5549fde363cc7caed9c0a2","kind":"constraint","required":true,"schema_version":"eidomancer.record.schema.v0.2"},{"id":"record:sha256:8881e19cc450b5068b1b016aa2c797d3a2a6d01b3555801e16914bb0ace7e0fd","kind":"constraint","required":true,"schema_version":"eidomancer.record.schema.v0.2"},{"id":"record:sha256:582173f5b8951b6a13f3fd5bbda5e176840186f1e088b6390eb87fae14ccb1c2","kind":"constraint","required":true,"schema_version":"eidomancer.record.schema.v0.2"}],"creator_operation_ref":{"id":"record:sha256:c58c91056ddb998b2093411962ffbad8e1ecb94a3109ef039d01bd213a838209","kind":"operation","required":true,"schema_version":"eidomancer.record.schema.v0.2"},"description":"Residents schedule a supply crossing for the second exposed phase, level 1, expecting enough time to move tools and gathered reeds across the porous stone before the next dusk. Work on shore takes longer than planned, however, and the loaded group reaches the band only after dusk has advanced the lagoon from level 1 to level 2. The crossing is now submerged and cannot be walked. The residents abandon the attempted crossing rather than treating the missed schedule as permission to use the stone underwater. Some floating reeds that had been gathered for later work are left near the band while the delayed supplies remain on their original shore. During levels 2 and 3, one cluster of those reeds settles onto the submerged porous stone and takes root. By the time the cycle returns through dusk from level 3 to level 0, the stone is exposed and walkable again, but the missed task has not simply been postponed unchanged: the rooted cluster now occupies part of the crossing surface and remains there after the water falls. Residents can resume moving supplies across the exposed band, but must route their traffic around the persistent patch or spend additional hand-tool labor managing access beside it. The original timing failure therefore creates a lasting spatial complication. A task planned around a temporary crossing window loses that window, material staged for the task interacts with the band during the intervening submerged phases, and the next usable crossing period begins from a different physical arrangement than the one on which the schedule was based.","facts":{"rooted_reed_patches":1,"water_level":0},"intelligence_response_ref":{"id":"record:sha256:4001bd4caff1a4ef4d772072a65ae710345d3f13bef706746eeb4a756b8c5f0c","kind":"intelligence_response","required":true,"schema_version":"eidomancer.record.schema.v0.2"},"rule_set_ref":{"id":"record:sha256:160332dbc409d7a8b8f670efc168a9ded69008366468b821af61a09308f85b90","kind":"rule_set","required":true,"schema_version":"eidomancer.record.schema.v0.2"},"seed_ref":{"id":"record:sha256:61922c6cc811cec3855bc5a044dd679699c5842aedb77cbdc273b40ea6ea2da1","kind":"seed","required":true,"schema_version":"eidomancer.record.schema.v0.2"}},"canonicalization_version":"eidomancer.jcs.v1","claim_class":"generated_candidate","kind":"world_state","provenance":{"actor_role":"environment","identification_status":"declared","input_refs":[{"id":"record:sha256:c58c91056ddb998b2093411962ffbad8e1ecb94a3109ef039d01bd213a838209","kind":"operation","required":true,"schema_version":"eidomancer.record.schema.v0.2"},{"id":"record:sha256:4001bd4caff1a4ef4d772072a65ae710345d3f13bef706746eeb4a756b8c5f0c","kind":"intelligence_response","required":true,"schema_version":"eidomancer.record.schema.v0.2"}],"model_or_version":"fictional.generic.v1","provider":"eidomancer"},"refs":[{"id":"record:sha256:160332dbc409d7a8b8f670ef